  "prompt": "When did each store first sell a Gaming line, and when did it first sell an Accessories line? Use the sales table; the webshop, WEB-01, counts as a store. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, first_gaming_date, the earliest order_date of the store's lines whose parent_category is 'Gaming', and first_accessories_date, the same for 'Accessories'. Every line counts, including a line with missing units or a missing net_revenue_eur. A store that never sold that parent category gets a missing date. Return one row per store_code. Any row order is fine.",
